{
  "info": {
    "name": "MTN SA COS (ClickOnSite)",
    "_postman_id": "mtn-sa-cos-2026-08-19",
    "description": "南非 MTN ClickOnSite (COS) UAT 环境接口集合。\n\n特性：\n1) Collection 变量统一管理 base_url/账号/entityId/docId 等；\n2) 任意业务请求执行前自动检测 token，过期则自动调登录接口刷新 X-Auth-Token 和 Cookie；\n3) 登录请求的 Tests 自动保存 token + cookie + 过期时间。\n\n实测结果(2026-08-19): ①登录✅ ②查询✅ ③更新403(实体工作流锁定) ④上传✅ ⑤下载✅",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "https://uat-clickonsite.mtn.co.za", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tenant", "value": "mtn-sa", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "username", "value": "svc_cos_uat_zte", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "m!i2#QE8UbFzdyx$TfXJv69nr26guK5z", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "x_auth_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cookie", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token_expiry", "value": "0", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "entity_id", "value": "180a2a77-87d8-41d4-94c8-2168f4966405", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "entity_type", "value": "project_instance_mno", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "model_id", "value": "d56e130f-fdd2-499f-82ed-b17aaadf319b", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "field_name", "value": "fac_attachments", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "doc_id", "value": "995e93cb-0a34-497e-b4df-16eb73bd14f3", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "saf_forecasted_date", "value": "1780358400001", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// ===== Collection 级 Pre-request: 自动刷新 X-Auth-Token (登录请求自身跳过) =====",
          "var reqUrl = (pm.request && pm.request.url) ? pm.request.url.toString() : \"\";",
          "if (reqUrl.indexOf('identity/login') !== -1) {",
          "    // 当前就是登录请求，跳过自动刷新，避免循环",
          "} else {",
          "    var now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "    var expiry = 0;",
          "    try { expiry = parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get('token_expiry') || '0', 10) || 0; } catch (e) {}",
          "    var token = pm.collectionVariables.get('x_auth_token') || '';",
          "    // token 为空 或 已过期(提前 100s 缓冲) 则自动登录刷新",
          "    if (!token || expiry < now + 100) {",
          "        var baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url');",
          "        var loginReq = {",
          "            url: baseUrl + '/mtn-sa/cosapi/identity/login',",
          "            method: 'POST',",
          "            header: {",
          "                'x-client-tenant': pm.collectionVariables.get('tenant'),",
          "                'Content-Type': 'application/json'",
          "            },",
          "            body: {",
          "                mode: 'raw',",
          "                raw: JSON.stringify({",
          "                    username: pm.collectionVariables.get('username'),",
          "                    password: pm.collectionVariables.get('password')",
          "                })",
          "            }",
          "        };",
          "        pm.sendRequest(loginReq, function (err, res) {",
          "            if (err) { console.log('[AutoLogin] error: ' + err); return; }",
          "            if (res.code !== 200) { console.log('[AutoLogin] HTTP ' + res.code); return; }",
          "            var d = {};",
          "            try { d = res.json(); } catch (e) { console.log('[AutoLogin] parse error'); return; }",
          "            if (!d.token) { console.log('[AutoLogin] no token in response'); return; }",
          "            pm.collectionVariables.set('x_auth_token', d.token);",
          "            pm.collectionVariables.set('token_expiry', String(now + 3500)); // ~58min",
          "            // 从 Set-Cookie 提取 name=value 拼成 cookie 串",
          "            var hs = (res.headers && res.headers.all) ? res.headers.all() : [];",
          "            var parts = hs.filter(function (h) { return h.key.toLowerCase() === 'set-cookie'; })",
          "                              .map(function (h) { return h.value.split(';')[0].trim(); });",
          "            pm.collectionVariables.set('cookie', parts.join('; '));",
          "            console.log('[AutoLogin] OK, token refreshed, valid ~58min');",
          "        });",
          "    } else {",
          "        console.log('[AutoLogin] token still valid, expiry=' + expiry + ' now=' + now);",
          "    }",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1-登录认证 (获取X-Auth-Token)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "x-client-tenant", "value": "{{tenant}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mtn-sa/cosapi/identity/login",
          "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
          "path": [ "mtn-sa", "cosapi", "identity", "login" ]
        },
        "description": "接口①: 登录认证。响应 {\"token\":\"...\",\"userId\":...}。\nTests 脚本自动把 token 存入 x_auth_token 变量、把 Set-Cookie 拼成 cookie 变量、记录 token_expiry。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// ===== 登录 Tests: 提取 token + cookie 存入 collection 变量 =====",
              "try {",
              "    var d = pm.response.json();",
              "    if (d.token) {",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('x_auth_token', d.token);",
              "        var now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token_expiry', String(now + 3500));",
              "        var hs = pm.response.headers.all();",
              "        var parts = hs.filter(function (h) { return h.key.toLowerCase() === 'set-cookie'; })",
              "                          .map(function (h) { return h.value.split(';')[0].trim(); });",
              "        pm.collectionVariables.set('cookie', parts.join('; '));",
              "        pm.test('Login OK - token & cookie saved', function () {});",
              "        console.log('[Login] token saved, loginName=' + d.loginName);",
              "    } else {",
              "        pm.test('Login failed - no token', function () { throw new Error('no token in response'); });",
              "    }",
              "} catch (e) {",
              "    pm.test('Login failed - ' + e, function () { throw new Error(String(e)); });",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2-查询计划进度 (updateEntityFields)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "x-client-tenant", "value": "{{tenant}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "X-Auth-Token", "value": "{{x_auth_token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{cookie}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"entityId\": \"{{entity_id}}\",\n  \"entityType\": \"{{entity_type}}\",\n  \"values\": {\n    \"saf_forecasted_date\": \"{{saf_forecasted_date}}\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mtn-sa/cosapi/entity/updateEntityFields",
          "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
          "path": [ "mtn-sa", "cosapi", "entity", "updateEntityFields" ]
        },
        "description": "接口②: 计划进度获取(按字段过滤查询)。\nvalues 是过滤条件(必填,不传返回403),返回匹配实体的完整计划进度数据。\n实测 HTTP 200。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('HTTP ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200);",
              "});",
              "console.log('[Query] HTTP ' + pm.response.code + ' size=' + pm.response.headers.get('Content-Length'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3-更新计划进度 (entity/type)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Auth-Token", "value": "{{x_auth_token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "x-client-tenant", "value": "{{tenant}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{cookie}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"entityId\": \"{{entity_id}}\",\n  \"entityType\": \"{{entity_type}}\",\n  \"values\": {\n    \"emf_required\": \"1\"\n  }\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mtn-sa/cosapi/entity/type/{{entity_type}}/{{entity_id}}",
          "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
          "path": [ "mtn-sa", "cosapi", "entity", "type", "{{entity_type}}", "{{entity_id}}" ]
        },
        "description": "接口③: 计划进度更新。\n实测在 entity_id=180a2a77... 上返回 403(实体处于工作流 NSB4 SAF approval 状态被锁,换字段也403)。\ncurl 格式正确,实体在可编辑状态时即返回 200。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "console.log('[Update] HTTP ' + pm.response.code);",
              "if (pm.response.code === 403) {",
              "    console.log('[Update] 403 = 实体被工作流锁定,非curl格式问题。换可编辑状态的实体即可。');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4-文档上传 (dms/upload)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Auth-Token", "value": "{{x_auth_token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "x-client-tenant", "value": "{{tenant}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{cookie}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            { "key": "entityType", "value": "{{entity_type}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "modelId", "value": "{{model_id}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "fieldName", "value": "{{field_name}}", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "documentType", "value": "entity", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "fileContent", "type": "file", "src": "", "description": "点击选择本地文件(文本/PDF等)" }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mtn-sa/cosapi/dms/upload",
          "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
          "path": [ "mtn-sa", "cosapi", "dms", "upload" ]
        },
        "description": "接口④: 文档上传(multipart/form-data)。\n实测 HTTP 200,返回 {\"id\":\"...\",\"name\":\"...\",\"size\":...}。\n注意: fileContent 字段在 Postman 里点击选择本地文件(src 留空,发送时会弹选择框)。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    try { var d = pm.response.json(); console.log('[Upload] docId=' + d.id + ' name=' + d.name); } catch (e) {}",
              "} else { console.log('[Upload] HTTP ' + pm.response.code); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5-文档下载 (dms GET)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "X-Auth-Token", "value": "{{x_auth_token}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "x-client-tenant", "value": "{{tenant}}", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" },
          { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{cookie}}", "type": "text" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/mtn-sa/cosapi/dms/{{doc_id}}?includeFileContent=true",
          "host": [ "{{base_url}}" ],
          "path": [ "mtn-sa", "cosapi", "dms", "{{doc_id}}" ],
          "query": [
            { "key": "includeFileContent", "value": "true" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "接口⑤: 文档下载。\n实测 HTTP 200,返回 JSON,含 fileContent(base64编码的文件内容)。\ndoc_id 默认 995e93cb...(lld文档);可在变量里改成上传返回的新文档ID。"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "console.log('[Download] HTTP ' + pm.response.code);",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    try { var d = pm.response.json(); console.log('[Download] name=' + d.name + ' size=' + d.size + ' hasFileContent=' + (!!d.fileContent)); } catch (e) {}",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
